{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43480","headline":"寒流聚细文 · 无名氏","name":"寒流聚细文","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晓野方闲眺，横溪赏乱流。\n寒文趋浦急，圆折逐烟浮。\n不谓飘疎雨，非关浴远鸥。\n观鱼鳞共细，间石影疑稠。\n猎猎风泠夕，潺潺濑响秋。\n仙槎如共泛，天汉适淹留。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43480.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43480","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}